け、恩徳から天恵になり、フェアリーバレットに変身する力を得る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"強い力を持つ反面、能力の感受性が強く、自らに向けられる欲望に対して脆弱で、戦闘での敗北などの不利な状況に陥るとたちまち相手の欲望に呑み込まれてしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27565","sourceWorkId":"39327","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"古富仁学園の一年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妖精の寵愛を受け、フェアリーバレットに変身する力を得る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"○い力を持つ反面、能力の感受性が○く、自らに向けられる欲望に対して脆弱で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"戦闘での敗北などの不利な状況に陥るとたちまち相手の欲望に呑み込まれてしまう。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"156496"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2c/2c658ded9f7283798887f264947cdc0e568803ea470a8f48906cca1958881da5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e64ca564214474eaa6544d3be74bfbb67935b748d4de767a2beacb735a17079.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c158745","characterName":"おくやま みゆき","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"187200","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"597373"}],"egsCharacterIds":["28200"],"vndbCharacterId":"c158745"},"originalCharacterName":"おくやま みゆき","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miyuki is always expressionless and unsociable at school, but perhaps due to her beauty, her classmates adore her for her mysterious presence."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She's not cold, she's just extremely bad at expressing emotion when people are face-to-face with her."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She still doesn't have any friends, but her goal is to make 100 by the time she graduates."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Estranged from her parents, she was raised by her grandparents."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Miyuki's ancestors are snow-woman spirits, and she uses her powers to transform into the ice fairy princess \"Fairy Snow\". She can freely manipulate ice and snow, purifying demons trapped within them. Even demons are captivated by her dance-like fighting style in the blizzard, wielding the folding fans in both hands."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c158745"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"雪女を先祖に持つ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あやかしの力で変身し、フェアリースノウとして戦う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"招宝学園の一年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親にはあやかしとしての能力はなく、子供のころから気味悪がられてきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"特殊能力のある子供を預かっていると言われている施設に預けられ、そこで戦い方を学ぶ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その施設は隠ノ翁が作ったもの。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"自分の力を人助けのために使いたいと考え、悪の組織との戦いに身を投じる。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28200","sourceWorkId":"39327","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"招宝学園に通う一年生。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園ではいつも無表情で、愛想がないものの、その美貌もあってか逆にミステリアスだとしてクラスメートたちから憧れの眼差しを向けられている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人は冷たくしているわけではなく、対面で表情を作るのが極端に苦手なだけである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"未だに友達はいないが、卒表までに百人作るのが目標。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両親とは疎遠で、祖父母に育てられた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"雪女のあやかしを先祖にもつ深雪は、その力で氷の妖姫フェアリースノウへと変身する。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"氷雪を自在に操り、氷の中に閉じ込めた妖魔を浄化することができる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"両手に持った扇子を操りながら、吹雪の中で舞うように戦う彼女の姿には、妖魔であっても魅了される。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"187200"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/3e/3e9a4c53436c0e6145255f8da18389e1641dac6c9841476ff156d282489198e4.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/07456df42d3c04f747162a12fc104370496d6a1cf5afd648bb77ef51100a23a2.webp","width":256,"height":255,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"楓花","creatorId":"vndb:s24062","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s24062","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s24062","name":"楓花","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","rel